id: SCA-047
title: Cargo.toml git dependency without rev pin
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Cargo.toml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: git\s*=\s*"[^"]+"
    message: Git dependency without pinned revision gets the latest commit. A compromised repo silently delivers malicious code.
fix: Pin git dependencies to a specific rev — package = { git = "url", rev = "abc123" }. Prefer crates.io packages over git dependencies.
